                </a>
                <a href="#morte" class="group block border-2 border-rose-200 bg-rose-50/50 p-4 rounded-xl hover:bg-rose-50 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-rose-400 transition-all text-center relative">
                    <span class="absolute -top-2 -right-2 bg-rose-500 text-white text-[10px] font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full shadow opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition">clique e leia mais</span>
                    <i data-lucide="hourglass" class="w-6 h-6 text-rose-600 mx-auto mb-2"></i>
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-rose-900">A Morte</h4>
                    <p class="text-[11px] text-rose-700 mt-1">A finitude que dá valor</p>
